qed:s1,s10,s4:syl2anc |- ( ( Q e. ( A |_| 1o ) /\ Z e. A ) -> ( ( v e. ( A |_| 1o ) |-> if ( v = ( inr ` (/) ) , Z , ( 2nd ` v ) ) ) ` Q ) = if ( Q = ( inr ` (/) ) , Z , ( 2nd ` Q ) ) )
